# Typed values drawn with their types' looks: a volcano's elevation (frontmatter) on the
# properties line, a VEI in prose and in a table as chips, a task's priority as a chip.
# tests/drive.rs adds Inbox/Today.md first. Colours can't be read here; chips' padding and
# icons can.
size 160x30
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace
keys p
type st. helens
wait-for 1 notes
keys enter
wait-for Volcanoes/Mount St. Helens  reading
wait-for ▲ 2549
expect VEI 5  eruption (see
screen
keys p
type explosivity
wait-for 1 notes
keys enter
wait-for Index (VEI)  reading
expect ┃ 6  │ Krakatoa 1883
expect-not ▲
screen
keys p
type today
wait-for 1 notes
keys enter
wait-for Inbox/Today  reading
wait-for Ring the observatory  ⏫
expect Read about Lava ✅ 2026-11-05
screen
keys esc
wait-gone reading · Esc / q back
keys q
exits 0
